{
  "title": "KLIA2酒店：晚到住机场还是直接进城",
  "slug": "klia2-capsule-hotel",
  "locale": "zh",
  "status": "PUBLISHED",
  "metaDescription": "深夜抵达KLIA2？比较CapsuleTransit胶囊酒店（3小时RM135起）、末班火车、深夜巴士和定价德士。",
  "featureImage": null,
  "translationOf": {
    "locale": "en",
    "slug": "klia2-capsule-hotel"
  },
  "contentBlocks": [
    {
      "blockType": "paragraph",
      "content": "<p>深夜在KLIA2落地，你有两个选择：在机场睡几个小时，或者现在就去市区的酒店。落地后能用的KLIA2酒店，是Gateway@klia2商场里的胶囊酒店CapsuleTransit Landside，3小时RM135起。另外两家吉隆坡机场酒店，Sama-Sama Express KLIA2和CapsuleTransit Airside，都在国际出境区，过了移民关卡就进不去。想回市区睡的话，末班火车在午夜到凌晨1点左右开出，部分巴士开得更晚，预订的德士任何时间都有。登机前先决定。</p>"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "h2",
      "content": "重点速览"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "paragraph",
      "content": "<p><strong>KLIA2有胶囊酒店吗？</strong>有。CapsuleTransit Landside在Gateway@klia2的公共区域，就在入境大厅旁，按小时预订。</p>"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "paragraph",
      "content": "<p><strong>落地后哪些机场酒店住不了？</strong>Sama-Sama Express KLIA2和CapsuleTransit Airside。两家都在国际出境区，供出境旅客使用。</p>"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "paragraph",
      "content": "<p><strong>KLIA2的末班火车几点？</strong>KLIA Transit末班车凌晨12:30从KLIA2开出。晚上11点起，KLIA Ekspres每站都停。</p>"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "paragraph",
      "content": "<p><strong>错过末班火车怎么办？</strong>部分巴士在午夜后仍有班次；提前预订的德士任何时间都会在入境大厅等你。</p>"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "h2",
      "content": "落地后能住的KLIA2酒店"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "paragraph",
      "content": "<div style=\"overflow-x:auto\"><table style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:0.95em\"><thead><tr><th style=\"border:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.35);padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;font-weight:700\">酒店</th><th style=\"border:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.35);padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;font-weight:700\">位置</th><th style=\"border:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.35);padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;font-weight:700\">落地后能住吗？</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.35);padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">CapsuleTransit Landside</td><td style=\"border:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.35);padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">Gateway@klia2商场，入境大厅旁</td><td style=\"border:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.35);padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">能</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.35);padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">CapsuleTransit MAX</td><td style=\"border:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.35);padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">KLIA2公共区域（landside）</td><td style=\"border:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.35);padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">能</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.35);padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">Tune Hotel KLIA-KLIA2</td><td style=\"border:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.35);padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">KLIA2旁边，从Level 1M经有盖走廊相连</td><td style=\"border:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.35);padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">能</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.35);padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">CapsuleTransit Airside</td><td style=\"border:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.35);padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">KLIA2国际出境区</td><td style=\"border:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.35);padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">不能，供出境旅客使用</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.35);padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">Sama-Sama Express KLIA2</td><td style=\"border:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.35);padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">卫星楼Level 3，国际出境大厅</td><td style=\"border:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.35);padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">不能，过了移民关卡就回不去禁区</td></tr></tbody></table></div>"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "paragraph",
      "content": "<p>Sama-Sama Express表示，客人一旦过了海关和移民关卡，酒店就无法让他们回到卫星楼区域（<a href=\"https://www.samasamaexpress.com/klia2/faqs-2/\">Sama-Sama Express</a>）。如果你是入境马来西亚，请选前三家之一。</p>"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "h2",
      "content": "KLIA2的CapsuleTransit胶囊酒店"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "paragraph",
      "content": "<p>CapsuleTransit Landside提供单人胶囊，分女性区、男性区和混合区，设有共用雨淋浴间、行李储物柜和24小时前台。按小时预订，3至24小时。同样在KLIA2公共区域的CapsuleTransit MAX有供两名成人入住的私人房间，房内有独立淋浴，还可使用休息室。有些订房网站仍用旧名Capsule by Container列出这家胶囊酒店。</p>"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "paragraph",
      "content": "<div style=\"overflow-x:auto\"><table style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:0.95em\"><thead><tr><th style=\"border:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.35);padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;font-weight:700\">时长</th><th style=\"border:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.35);padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;font-weight:700\">单人胶囊，Landside（1名成人）</th><th style=\"border:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.35);padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top;font-weight:700\">豪华房，MAX（2名成人）</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.35);padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">3小时</td><td style=\"border:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.35);padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">RM135</td><td style=\"border:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.35);padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">RM260</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.35);padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">6小时</td><td style=\"border:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.35);padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">RM155</td><td style=\"border:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.35);padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">RM290</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.35);padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">12小时</td><td style=\"border:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.35);padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">RM175</td><td style=\"border:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.35);padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">RM330</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.35);padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">24小时</td><td style=\"border:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.35);padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">RM195</td><td style=\"border:1px solid rgba(127,127,127,.35);padding:8px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top\">RM400</td></tr></tbody></table></div>"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "paragraph",
      "content": "<p>价格取自<a href=\"https://capsuletransit.com/klia-2/landside\">CapsuleTransit Landside</a>和<a href=\"https://capsuletransit.com/klia-2/max\">CapsuleTransit MAX</a>页面，2026年10月11日核对；价格会变动。登机前在CapsuleTransit网站订好，落地就有床位。</p>"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "h2",
      "content": "Tune Hotel KLIA-KLIA2"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "paragraph",
      "content": "<p>Tune Hotel KLIA-KLIA2有带独立浴室的私人房间，从航站楼走过去不远。出了入境大厅，朝FamilyMart方向走，搭扶梯下到Level 1M，右转，跟着指示牌走到有盖天桥。Tune Hotels说步行约8至12分钟（<a href=\"https://tunehotels.com/malaysia-hotels/klia2/\">Tune Hotels</a>）。日间房开放时间为早上7点至晚上7点；如果预订座位，酒店穿梭巴士在早上5点、7点、9点和11点开往KLIA第一航站楼。房价请在Tune Hotels网站查看，落地前订好。</p>"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "h2",
      "content": "直接进城：深夜还有哪些交通"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "h3",
      "content": "火车"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "paragraph",
      "content": "<p>晚上11点起，所有KLIA Ekspres列车每站都停，到KL Sentral的时间会变长；KLIA Ekspres网站说深夜班次开到凌晨1点左右（<a href=\"https://www.kliaekspres.com/products-fares/klia-ekspres/\">KLIA Ekspres</a>）。KLIA Transit末班车凌晨12:30从KLIA2开出，凌晨1:09到达KL Sentral（<a href=\"https://www.kliaekspres.com/products-fares/klia-transit/\">KLIA Transit</a>）。售票柜台晚上11点关闭。落地前在网上买票，车费可减10%。</p>"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "h3",
      "content": "巴士"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "paragraph",
      "content": "<p>部分巴士公司在午夜后仍有从KLIA2出发的班次，但时间会变。登机前在<a href=\"https://ttklia.com/bus/destinations?utm_source=teeko&amp;utm_medium=blog&amp;utm_campaign=klia2_capsule_hotel&amp;utm_content=zh\">ttklia.com</a>查看当晚的班次。巴士从Level 1的交通枢纽出发，我们的<a href=\"/zh/blog/klia2-bus-station\">KLIA2巴士站指南</a>有走法。</p>"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "h3",
      "content": "德士或Grab"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "paragraph",
      "content": "<p>Grab在交通枢纽的LG层上车。车费随需求变动，午夜后的价格可能和中午差很多。在ttklia.com预订的德士，价格在预订时就定好。司机会跟踪你的航班，举着名牌在入境大厅等你。想到了机场再叫车，可以看我们的<a href=\"/zh/blog/klia2-airport-taxi\">KLIA2德士柜台指南</a>。</p>"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "cta",
      "content": {
        "heading": "预订KLIA2深夜德士",
        "subheading": "预订时就定价，可选轿车、MPV或客货车。司机跟踪你的航班，在入境大厅等你。",
        "buttonText": "预订KLIA2进城德士",
        "url": "https://ttklia.com/taxi/klia2-to-bukit-bintang-bangsar?utm_source=teeko&utm_medium=blog&utm_campaign=klia2_capsule_hotel&utm_content=zh"
      }
    },
    {
      "blockType": "h2",
      "content": "住机场还是进城：怎么选"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "paragraph",
      "content": "<ul><li><strong>晚上11点前落地，行李不多。</strong>搭火车。我们的<a href=\"/zh/blog/klia2-to-kl-sentral\">KLIA2到KL Sentral指南</a>把火车和巴士做了比较。</li><li><strong>午夜后落地，酒店在市区。</strong>订德士；住Bukit Bintang的话，看看<a href=\"/zh/blog/klia2-to-bukit-bintang\">KLIA2到Bukit Bintang指南</a>。</li><li><strong>第二天一早又要飞。</strong>住胶囊或Tune的房间，可以省下两趟机场车程。</li><li><strong>下一程从KLIA第一航站楼起飞。</strong>看我们的<a href=\"/zh/blog/klia1-to-klia2\">KLIA1到KLIA2指南</a>，了解早班火车和穿梭巴士。</li><li><strong>一家人出行。</strong>单人胶囊只睡一名成人。把私人房间和直接搭德士去市区酒店比较一下。</li></ul>"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "paragraph",
      "content": "<p>看看你几点落地，对照上面选一种，登机前订好。</p>"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "h2",
      "content": "常见问题"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "h3",
      "content": "KLIA2有胶囊酒店吗？"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "paragraph",
      "content": "<p>有。KLIA2的胶囊酒店CapsuleTransit Landside在Gateway@klia2商场，就在入境大厅旁，过了移民关卡也能入住。</p>"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "h3",
      "content": "KLIA2胶囊酒店多少钱？"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "paragraph",
      "content": "<p>根据2026年10月11日核对的CapsuleTransit Landside页面，这家KLIA2酒店的单人胶囊3小时RM135，6小时RM155，12小时RM175，24小时RM195。价格会变动，订之前再查一次。</p>"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "h3",
      "content": "落地后可以住Sama-Sama Express KLIA2吗？"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "paragraph",
      "content": "<p>不可以。Sama-Sama Express KLIA2在国际出境区，入境马来西亚、过了移民关卡之后就回不去禁区。</p>"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "h3",
      "content": "KLIA2的末班火车几点？"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "paragraph",
      "content": "<p>KLIA Transit从KLIA2开出的末班车是凌晨12:30。晚上11点起KLIA Ekspres每站都停，深夜班次开到凌晨1点左右。出发当天请再查看KLIA Ekspres网站。</p>"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "h3",
      "content": "Capsule by Container和CapsuleTransit是同一家吗？"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "paragraph",
      "content": "<p>是的。Capsule by Container是一些订房网站仍在使用的旧名，指的就是KLIA2的CapsuleTransit。</p>"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "h2",
      "content": "总结"
    },
    {
      "blockType": "paragraph",
      "content": "<p>深夜抵达KLIA2，可以住CapsuleTransit Landside（3小时RM135起），走去Tune Hotel KLIA-KLIA2，或者直接进城。末班火车在午夜到凌晨1点左右开出，部分巴士更晚。想任何时间都有车等你，登机前<a href=\"https://ttklia.com/taxi/klia2-to-bukit-bintang-bangsar?utm_source=teeko&amp;utm_medium=blog&amp;utm_campaign=klia2_capsule_hotel&amp;utm_content=zh\">在ttklia.com预订KLIA2德士</a>。</p>"
    }
  ]
}
